        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM4402 Centrex Double Curved Door Pull </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRockwood's Centrex Double Curved Pulls with 90 degree bent ends offer elegance and comfort in a sleek design.  The curved style creates a unique and distinctive look as a commercial store front handle.  Available in 5 durable finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 3 different materials in 5 finish choices.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Aluminum: Dark Bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass: Polished Brass or Satin Brass finishes.</li>\r\n<li>Solid 304 Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rockwood RM4402 12\" Double Curved Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: 1/4-20 </li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please order 1 right hand and 1 left hand pull.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Centrex Double Curved Pulls, Rockwood RM4402",
                "description": "Rockwood's Centrex Double Curved Pulls with 90 degree bent ends offer elegance and comfort in a sleek design.  The curved style creates a unique and distinctive look as a commercial store front handle.  Available in several finishes including marine grade 316 stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance in harsh environments.",
